  "body": "Call now for your private viewing.\r\n\r\nTreat yourself to something truly special — a rare waterfront opportunity in one of Gulf Harbour’s most exclusive enclaves.\r\n\r\nPositioned within the tightly held and highly sought-after cul-de-sac of Rue d’Amarres in the prestigious Cap d’Amarres Estate, this beautifully appointed waterfront residence offers an exceptional lifestyle defined by space, sunshine and seamless marina living.\r\n\r\nBuilt by Jalcon Homes, a well-established and highly regarded New Zealand residential construction company, the property reflects a strong focus on quality construction and considered design.\r\n\r\nSpread across two levels and designed for effortless coastal living, the home features five bedrooms and four bathrooms, including a self-contained one-bedroom apartment with its own private entrance — ideal for extended family, guests or a nanny.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a high-spec kitchen is complemented by a generous butler’s pantry. Open-plan living flows effortlessly to a spacious north-facing deck overlooking the marina, creating the perfect setting for entertaining or simply relaxing beside the water.\r\n\r\nThe upper level captures the essence of waterfront living, with expansive canal views, multiple bedrooms, a home office and balconies designed to make the most of the all-day sun. The lower level offers excellent flexibility, with options for a second living area or fifth bedroom, along with a powder room, laundry and seamless indoor-outdoor flow to the entertaining areas.\r\n\r\nA true standout is the private 14-metre marina berth, positioned directly in your backyard. Step from your home straight onto your boat and embrace the ultimate in waterfront convenience.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by other premium homes, this exceptional property enjoys an enviable lifestyle location. Shakespear Regional Park, Pohutukawa-fringed beaches, local shops, Gulf Harbour Marina and the ferry service to Auckland CBD — approximately 50 minutes — are all close at hand.\r\n\r\nExcellent schooling options are also within easy reach, including Wentworth Primary and Secondary Schools and Gulf Harbour Primary School, all within walking distance.\r\n\r\nSet within a secure and prestigious waterfront community, this is low-maintenance luxury living at its finest — arguably offering more than a lifestyle block and far more immersive than simply having a sea view. Here, you are truly at the water’s edge.\r\n\r\nWith motivated overseas vendors committed to selling, opportunities of this calibre are exceptionally rare.\r\n\r\nCanal-side living at its best — premium, private and almost impossible to find.\r\n\r\nVendor Says Sell — your opportunity is here.",
